{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Idle Chapel is a dark-fantasy incremental game about confronting a rising cult.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Find cultists and bring them back to faith</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your cross to confront cultists and turn them into worshipers:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4102010/extras/0ff87712f63e987e0be51ce0f34f21c6.poster.avif?t=1774776009\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4102010/extras/0ff87712f63e987e0be51ce0f34f21c6.webm?t=1774776009\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4102010/extras/0ff87712f63e987e0be51ce0f34f21c6.mp4?t=1774776009\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Grow your chapel</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Worshipers pray and produce devotion, which you can spend on upgrades and new areas:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4102010/extras/09d067d8a1a2ec69b97569176b575c4b.poster.avif?t=1774776009\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4102010/extras/09d067d8a1a2ec69b97569176b575c4b.webm?t=1774776009\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4102010/extras/09d067d8a1a2ec69b97569176b575c4b.mp4?t=1774776009\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Perform penance</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reset your run to unlock powerful upgrades in the penance tree:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4102010/extras/3192f61ef9233e3f23e794fc233b1570.poster.avif?t=1774776009\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4102010/extras/3192f61ef9233e3f23e794fc233b1570.webm?t=1774776009\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4102010/extras/3192f61ef9233e3f23e794fc233b1570.mp4?t=1774776009\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric idle/clicker gameplay (2-4h to complete)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >12 areas to explore and purify</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dark-fantasy pixel art aesthetic</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Penance tree for long-term progression</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A light narrative thread uncovering what happened</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lo-fi synth soundtrack for a moody vibe</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4102010?t=1774776009","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4102010?t=1774776009","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4102010/4f41a4c4c4d491e7159a07e1a04f245cd05bb3d6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774776009","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4102010/4f41a4c4c4d491e7159a07e1a04f245cd05bb3d6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774776009","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_desc